<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-beishi" book-id="b-beishi-042" chapter-id="c-beishi-042-wangyi" source-id="s-beishi-042-wangyi-ws2626092">
  <p id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA">翊</persName>字<persName id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA">士遊</persName>，<persName id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001:m0005" ref="l1w_swd_dj8">肅</persName>次兄<persName id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001:m0008" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAA">深</persName>子也。風神秀立，好學有文才。位中書侍郎。頗銳於榮利，結婚於元叉。為濟州刺史，清靜有政績。入為散騎常侍、金紫光祿大夫，領國子祭酒。</p>
  <p id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">卒，贈司空公、徐州刺史。子<persName id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p002:m0013" ref="w34_b6a_3nn">琛</persName>，武定中，儀同、開府記室參軍。</p>
</text>
